$Descr User 72100 34450
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "DC-Modules 120 kW — DC-DC board (3-phase LLC, 4x cells)"
Date "2026-09-06"
Rev "D.3"
Comp "DC-Modules 120 kW - board DC-DC (upper), sheet 2 of 2"
Comment1 "Module 120 kW = two-board sandwich: sheet 1 AC-DC (lower) + sheet 2 DC-DC (upper), bolted DCP/DCN/PE studs + 16-way control harness"
Comment2 "Content: 4x Vienna PFC cells + 4x 3-ph LLC cells"
Comment3 "45 functional sections - 744 components - cross-section links are global net labels; wires are pin stubs only"
Comment4 "Every component carries MPN + LCSC fields (CLASS = buy to class spec, CUSTOM = made to drawing)"
$EndDescr
